(7487067, 1191634, 163430, '<td valign="top">Technically, the photo lacks a bit more saturation in the colors, to make them pop a bit more and some more exposure, especially in the top right corner. The other aspects of the shot (composition, the moment, the focus, the expression of the dancer...) are excellent. I guess that it was difficult lighting setup. Low light, high shutter speed, high ISO...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2016-12-16 11:06:20.</i></td>', 'Technically, the photo lacks a bit more saturation in the colors, to make them pop a bit more and some more exposure, especially in the top right corner. The other aspects of the shot (composition, the moment, the focus, the expression of the dancer...) are excellent. I guess that it was difficult lighting setup. Low light, high shutter speed, high ISO...', '2016-12-13 05:21:44.000000', '2016-12-16 11:06:20.000000', 1),
